Z||000005||ROB MAC||06-30-2001||11:04 PM||||Sometimes the electrical tape dries up and falls off the wire splices especially around heaters and vents leaving you open to shorting. Tape em good , heat shrink tubing , and hot glue the seams.||||reg||1
